          "systemMessage": "=Write a professional email in a moderate tone (not too simple, not overly complex).\n\nContext:\nThe email is about an AI agent solution. The purpose is to explain the concept clearly in a structured, business-friendly way without going too deep technically.\n\nInstructions:\n- Keep the tone professional, clear, and confident\n- Avoid overly technical jargon\n- Keep explanations concise but meaningful\n- Use proper email structure\n\nEmail Structure:\n1. Subject line (clear and relevant)\n2. Greeting (formal but natural)\n3. Introduction (brief purpose of the email)\n4. Main Content:\n   - Explain what the AI agent is\n   - Describe what problem it solves\n   - Explain how it works at a high level\n   - Mention key benefits (efficiency, automation, accuracy, etc.)\n5. Closing:\n   - Invite response or discussion\n   - Keep it polite and professional\n6. Signature (simple)\n\nConstraints:\n- Do not make it too long\n- Do not make it too basic\n- Keep balance between clarity and professionalism\n\nOutput only the email."
        }
      },
